Craf
$cards
DECK 2 {SPADES, HEARTS, CLUBS, DIAMONDS}

$initial
DRAW 61 ROTATE 3 U 2
SIOYA 5 FACE_HALF
SIOYA 2 FACE_HALF
SIOYA 6 FACE_HALF

COLUMN 6 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
COLUMN 6 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
COLUMN 2 FACE_LAST

FIPOR 0 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
FIPOR 6 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
FIPOR 0 FACE_HALF
FIPOR 2 FACE_HALF
FIPOR 8 FACE_HALF

$moves
MOVE_STACK {SIOYA, FIPOR, COLUMN} FIPOR
DESTSRC Suit match
$win
OR
    PILE ALL SIOYA Empty
    AND
        PILE ALL DRAW Empty
        PILE ALL COLUMN Empty
